                "Are the margins structural? An EMS margin lasts if the product is complex and the customer values reliability over price; it is fragile if the product is standard and the fee is fixed per unit. In either case, passing on higher component costs lowers the percentage margin, so look at rupee profit per unit too. Several FY26 and Q1 profits also carry one-off items that should not be treated as recurring.",
