            "**Scale EMS building components.** **Syrma: follow** (from own). The best balance of growth and quality here, but Q1 margin and working capital went the wrong way and the price needs about {need:Syrma SGS Tech.|31}% a year; operating cash was ₹274cr against ₹856cr of profit over FY22–FY26, though FY26 converted 84%. I would buy on a fall of roughly a third if cash conversion holds. **Kaynes: wait.** A strong core business, until metering cash comes in and a new auditor signs clean accounts. **Sahasra: avoid.** Stock records that did not tally, a promoter merger and a chip unit far below plan.",
